// Takes D when C goes on, holds it till the next time. Two latches: the
// first locked while C is on, the second while it's off. The first one's
// delay outlasts the second one locking, so nothing slips through.
name D flip-flop
port d D in
port c C in
port q Q out
delay 2 0 0 4
layer
d-→→q
..↑↑.
c--↑.
-..^.
-..#.
-..-.
----.
